        "body": "Dropbox is a for-profit public company founded in 2007 and headquartered in San Francisco, CA. It describes itself as a provider of secure cloud storage, file sharing, and collaboration tools, and promotes its Dash product as a way to save time and organize company content in one place. The company trades under the ticker DBX and reported revenue of $2,521,000,000 for the period ending December 31, 2025, according to its most recent 10-K filing.\n\nOn the AI side, Dropbox offers a product called Dropbox AI, categorized under Notes, Knowledge, and Meetings, which provides document summaries, cloud storage intelligence, and sharing controls centered on team data. The company's registry presence extends to the Model Context Protocol ecosystem, where a third-party MCP server enables users to search, browse, and read Dropbox files, find documents by name or content, and list folders.",
